WEBVTT

00:00:00.486 --> 00:00:06.154
Good morning and we are at day two of the
OpenSSL conference in Prague.

00:00:06.342 --> 00:00:10.629
This morning we've got Carla
from the OpenSSL Foundation Committee.

00:00:10.629 --> 00:00:14.507
Carla, you've just tried the
90-second Digital Wellness Reset.

00:00:14.507 --> 00:00:18.641
Could you just tell us a little bit about your
experience and what you thought of

00:00:18.641 --> 00:00:18.794
it?

00:00:19.558 --> 00:00:21.770
Well, I thought, Sangeeta, that it was

00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:24.778
extremely clever. I loved the pause,

00:00:24.998 --> 00:00:29.066
the ability just for people to be
able to take a few seconds to

00:00:29.254 --> 00:00:32.464
think about what they're doing
before they click.

00:00:32.464 --> 00:00:34.887
I think it's a really simple message.

00:00:34.887 --> 00:00:36.394
The cat is adorable, and

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.122
for me, it was just a very

00:00:38.406 --> 00:00:40.074
clever way of conveying

00:00:40.198 --> 00:00:41.034
and

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:43.434
how to be cyber safe out there.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.738
Thank you, Carla. Thank you very much.
